title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Result first: eligibility, benefits, what the service needs
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: How the label and value rows under the verdict are worked out from the patient's row and from the saved Payers configuration. Eligibility says eligible, not eligible or needs a fix, with the dates. Benefits says covered or not, with the codes and the service limit; Patient pays follows only when the plan has a cost share. What this service needs says whether an authorization is required, on file or not required, and shows the payer's saved rules, read only. Values, not sentences.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: effective dates, limits and cost share are sample data, and the check is simulated.
---
start s1 "Result page, rows under the verdict band"

group gE "Row 'Eligibility'"
  decision e0 "What did the state or plan say?"
  process e1 "Pill 'Eligible' (green)\n'Effective 01/01/2026, no end date'"
  process e2 "Pill 'Not eligible' (red)\n'Effective 01/01/2026, ended 09/30/2026'\nand '· with Cardinal Health Plan since 10/01' when the member moved"
  process e3 "Pill 'Needs a fix' (red)\n'Effective 01/01/2026, lapsed 10/12/2026'\nButton 'Request retro-eligibility' on the band"
  process e4 "Pill 'Needs a fix' (red)\n'No coverage found for these details'\nNo dates"
  process e5 "Pill 'Needs a fix' (red)\n'Active, under the member ID ending 5521'"
  process e6 "Pill 'Not checked' (grey)\n'Not asked: Verify is paused in Settings'"
endgroup

process nf "Benefits and What this service needs say 'Not checked' (grey), 'Not asked'\nNo limit, no cost share, no Payers rules"

group gB "Rows 'Benefits' and 'Patient pays'"
  decision b0 "What do the benefits say?"
  process b1 "Pill 'Covered' (green)\n'Residential 3.5 · H0018 and H0019'"
  process b2 "Pill 'Limited' (amber)\n'PHP, with conditions · H0035'"
  process b3 "Pill 'Not covered' (red)\n'Residential 3.5 not covered · H0018 and H0019'"
  process b10 "Pill 'Not confirmed' (amber)\n'PHP not confirmed by Harborview · H0035'"
  decision b4 "Is a service limit on file?"
  process b5 "Added to the row: '· 9 of 14 days used, 5 left'\n(or '· 38 of 48 units used, 10 left'), '· All 14 days used' when none is left"
  process b6 "Added to the row: '· No annual day limit' (Summit residential)\nOtherwise nothing"
  decision b7 "Does this plan type have a cost share on file?"
  process b8 "Row 'Patient pays'\n'Copay $40 per day, deductible $350 left, coinsurance 20% after the deductible'\nMedicare Advantage: 'Deductible $85 left, coinsurance 20%'"
  process b9 "No 'Patient pays' row\nOhio Medicaid members usually pay none, so there is no '$0'"
endgroup

group gN "Row 'What this service needs'"
  decision n0 "What is the authorization state?"
  process n1 "Pill 'Not required' (grey)\n'Beacon does not require one for IOP · 10/21/2026 to 10/31/2026'\nAlso when the payer's saved rule 'No authorization needed' names this level of care"
  process n7 "Pill 'Requirement unknown' (grey)\n'No rule on file for Beacon and residential 3.5'\nAlso for a payer added on Payers that does not cover this level of care"
  process n2 "Pill 'On file' (green)\n'On file with Summit'"
  process n3 "Pill 'Required, not on file' (amber)\n'Before the first day'"
  process n4 "Pills 'In progress', 'Payer reviewing' or 'Retro request open'\n'Before the first day · request being drafted', 'Under review with Cardinal', 'For days already delivered'"
  process n5 "Quiet second line from the Payers config, read live\n'Summit rules: Notice within 24 hours of admission · 9 documents on the Residential 3.5 list'\nEdit the rule or the list on Payers and this line follows"
  click n6 "Click 'Open Summit's rules'"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Read the rules"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Which verdict and why"

s1 --> e0
e0 -->|Active| e1 --> b0
e0 -->|Ended| e2 --> b0
e0 -->|Lapsed| e3 --> b0
e0 -->|Not found| e4 --> nf --> g3
e0 -->|Other member ID| e5 --> b0
e0 -->|Verify paused| e6 --> nf
b0 -->|Covered| b1 --> b4
b0 -->|Limited| b2 --> b4
b0 -->|Not covered| b3 --> b4
b0 -->|Not confirmed| b10 --> b4
b4 -->|Yes| b5 --> b7
b4 -->|No| b6 --> b7
b7 -->|Yes| b8 --> n0
b7 -->|No| b9 --> n0
n0 -->|Not required| n1 --> n5
n0 -->|Unknown| n7
n0 -->|On file| n2 --> n5
n0 -->|Required| n3 --> n5
n0 -->|Drafted, reviewing, retro| n4 --> n5
n5 --> n6 --> g1
n5 --> g3
n7 --> g3
e3 -.-> g2
